<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Amoco near-term rating raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Amoco near-term rating raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised the near-term rating of Amoco Corp to an accumulate from neutral on Wednesday. It kept the long-term rating of the stock at buy.</p>
<p>-- Amoco shares closed at 77-1/2 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
